  <item>
    <title>20 祛魅的本质是经历过</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65684a959f440f5443db0760</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65684a959f440f5443db0760</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Nov 2023 08:40:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>曾经我们眼中那些遥不可及的远处和闪耀，一步步走近时，你是否有过失望，或者是满足预期？相信我们都有过这样的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>拨开云雾之后的本质，又是否是我们真正想要去靠近和想要的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们来聊聊祛魅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>世间一切并不新奇，只要我们经历过。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 聊这个话题的缘由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 祛魅的根源来自于期待过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 本质是经历过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 祛魅过后的轻松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 在真正找到自己真正想要之前，一定有无数的试验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> 体验的基础来源于好身体</span></p><span></span><p><span>【入群指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span>请加姑姑微信：Xinhealthcare2022，留言“北调南腔”入群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【工作联系】</span></p><span></span><p><span>beidiaonanqiang22@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播出品】可通过微信小程序搜索</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡里：“宇宙场”咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>姑姑：“劉姑姑陳皮”</span></p>]]></description>
